> I don't know how many PCI buses there are in XL 300, but if there is more

> than one, make sure the video card is installed in a slot on the bus 0.

That Powerstorm has a Cirrus VGA chip for console text mode, so it should

init it OK.

Single PCI bus on XL300, but AFAIK, it should NOT have onboard SCSI,

just Ethernet.

Are you sure its really an XL300 (aka XLT)? It has to have an EV5 CPU

to be XLT, otherwise (EV45) it is XL-233/266.

--Jay++

